              "value": "Breath Weapon"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(arcane, evocation)\n\nThe dracolisk breathes a gout of energy based on its draconic heritage, as noted below. This breath weapon deals 6d10 damage of the appropriate type, with a 28 basic save of a type indicated in parenthesis below. The dracolisk can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds."
